  "releaseNotes": "HTTP DSL: the assertions chain before the await, without (await ...ExecuteAsync()).Then(): await Given()...ExecuteAsync().AssertStatusCode(201).JsonPath<string>(\"$.id\"). Every public method of HttpValidationBuilder has a counterpart on Task<HttpValidationBuilder>, except the two with an out parameter. Additive: the parenthesized form keeps working, and no code changes are needed from 6.7.0. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
